---
import Layout from '~/layouts/Layout.astro';
import { getHomePermalink } from '~/utils/permalinks';

const title = `页面未找到 - Agent KG Hub`;
---

<Layout metadata={{ title }}>
  <section class="flex items-center h-full p-16">
    <div class="container flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-5 mx-auto my-8">
      <div class="max-w-md text-center">
        <h2 class="mb-8 font-bold text-9xl">
          <span class="sr-only">Error</span>
          <span class="text-primary">404</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-3xl font-semibold md:text-3xl">这里没有内容</p>
        <p class="mt-4 mb-8 text-lg text-muted dark:text-slate-400">
          你访问的页面可能已被移除、地址输错了,或者还没有创建。回到首页继续探索吧。
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center">
          <a rel="noopener noreferrer" href={getHomePermalink()} class="btn-primary">回到首页</a>
          <a
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            href="https://github.com/LyuBailin/agent-kg-hub/issues"
            class="btn-secondary"
            target="_blank"
          >
            报告问题
          </a>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-8 text-sm text-muted dark:text-slate-500">
          也可以试试
          <a href="/agent-kg-hub/articles" class="text-primary hover:underline">全部文章</a>
          或
          <a href="/agent-kg-hub/about" class="text-primary hover:underline">关于本站</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
